  "description": "Studio conventions for Model Context Protocol servers built on the official C# SDK. One AddStudioMcp call gives a server its name, title and instructions, JSON that keeps non-Latin text readable and enums in the schema, schema-checked arguments with errors a model can act on, clean refusals instead of the SDK's generic wrapper, per-caller rate limits, a result size budget, call observers and OpenTelemetry metrics. Tools stay plain [McpServerTool] methods. Targets net6.0 through net11.0.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
  "id": "TechTeaStudio.Mcp",
