  "published": "2026-11-13T19:52:39.897Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v0.1.0: First release. AddStudioMcp with required name, title and instructions; StudioMcpJson (snake_case or camelCase, relaxed escaping, string enums in the schema, nulls omitted); a call pipeline with argument checks against the input schema (unknown arguments refused, a null takes the default), refusals without the SDK prefix, a generic message for unexpected failures, per-caller rate limits keyed by the readOnly annotation, a result size budget that never refuses a write, IMcpCallObserver and the TechTeaStudio.Mcp meter; output schemas that no longer require fields the JSON leaves out when null.\n\nFull changelog: https://github.com/TechTeaStudio/Mcp/blob/product/CHANGELOG.md",
